---
---

<section id="how" class="manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
    <div class="manifesto-copy">
        <h2 id="manifesto-title">Pick a limit.<br /><em>Build within the limit.</em></h2>
        <p>
            After the Website, each Mini challenge sets one measurable limit. Limits cover file size, board size,
            screen size, character count, or time.
        </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="process-list">
        <li><span>1</span><div><strong>Choose a limit</strong><p>Pick bytes, millimeters, pixels, characters, or seconds.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>2</span><div><strong>Build your project</strong><p>Make a complete, original project within the chosen limit.</p></div></li>
        <li><span>3</span><div><strong>Submit!</strong><p>Submit your project, and we'll ship you a prize :)</p></div></li>
    </ol>

    <p class="process-note">Challenge Projects must take a minimum of 5 hours of work, tracked via Hackatime or Lapse</p>

    <div class="catalogue">
        <header class="catalogue-heading">
            <div>
                <h2 id="catalogue-title">Choose your<br />next challenge.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>After you complete the first challenge,<br />complete one more or complete them <strong>all.</strong></p>
        </header>

        <div class="challenge-grid">
            <article class="challenge-card" id="postage-pcb">
                <header class="card-index">
                    <span>02</span>
                    <span>physical space</span>
                </header>

                <div class="card-title">
                    <p class="card-measure">≤ 20 × 20 MM</p>
                    <h3>Postage PCB</h3>
                    <p class="challenge-pitch">beep boop beep click clack</p>
                </div>

                <dl class="card-brief">
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE LIMIT</dt>
                        <dd>Make a PCB that fits within a 20x20mm square, that actually does something.</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE PRIZE</dt>
                        <dd>Up to $25 toward fabrication and parts for approved projects.</dd>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </article>

            <article class="challenge-card" id="minute-game">
                <header class="card-index">
                    <span>03</span>
                    <span>time</span>
                </header>

                <div class="card-title">
                    <p class="card-measure">≤ 60 SEC</p>
                    <h3>Minute Game</h3>
                    <p class="challenge-pitch">You can scroll one reel... maybe two...</p>
                </div>

                <dl class="card-brief">
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE LIMIT</dt>
                        <dd>After 60 seconds, the game should reset. It's up to you how to interpret that! Maybe your past lives interfere with your future ones?</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE PRIZE</dt>
                        <dd>A controller to play your game with!</dd>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </article>

            <article class="challenge-card" id="tiny-display">
                <header class="card-index">
                    <span>04</span>
                    <span>pixels</span>
                </header>

                <div class="card-title">
                    <p class="card-measure">32 × 32 PX</p>
                    <h3>Tiny Display</h3>
                    <p class="challenge-pitch">Let me OUT OF HERE-</p>
                </div>

                <dl class="card-brief">
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE LIMIT</dt>
                        <dd>Keep all visuals inside a 32 × 32 pixel canvas. Scale the canvas without adding pixels. Make something interactive.</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE PRIZE</dt>
                        <dd>A 32 × 32 RGB LED matrix panel.</dd>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </article>

            <article class="challenge-card" id="one-file">
                <header class="card-index">
                    <span>05</span>
                    <span>files</span>
                </header>

                <div class="card-title">
                    <p class="card-measure">1 FILE</p>
                    <h3>One File</h3>
                    <p class="challenge-pitch">Just how Claude intended.</p>
                </div>

                <dl class="card-brief">
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE LIMIT</dt>
                        <dd>All your source code must live in one file, including assets! This <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr3VsZYQy4s">game</a> used only sine waves for all of its art!</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE PRIZE</dt>
                        <dd>A $10 USD Domain grant.</dd>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </article>

            <article class="challenge-card" id="golf">
                <header class="card-index">
                    <span>06</span>
                    <span>lines</span>
                </header>

                <div class="card-title">
                    <p class="card-measure">≤ 100 LINES</p>
                    <h3>Golf</h3>
                    <p class="challenge-pitch">Hole in One! </p>
                </div>

                <dl class="card-brief">
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE LIMIT</dt>
                        <dd>Keep your full source code at 100 lines or less.</dd>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <dt>THE PRIZE</dt>
                        <dd>An Orpheus Pico 2.</dd>
                    </div>
                </dl>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
